schema: source-system
object:
  title: ReFi DAO Local Node Incubator / Local Nodes network
  type: convening
  steward: ReFi DAO
  what_it_curates: >-
    An 8-15 week structured incubator program for place-based regenerative-
    finance chapters ("local nodes"), plus a live global directory of those
    nodes. Source of the Seed/Sapling/Canopy node-maturity model cited in
    onboarding-members.md; the article reports a cohort of 100-plus
    participants and a steward Net Promoter Score of 9.4/10.
  why_it_matters: >-
    Primary named framework and evidence source for the article's node-growth
    model and steward-burnout-prevention argument; also the network layer the
    article tells stewards to lean on ("that's not central overreach, that's
    mutual aid").
  how_to_credit: Credit ReFi DAO and the Local Node Incubator program.
  use_type: cited framework + directory referenced for onboarding guidance
  reuse_conditions: Not stated in the source article; public blog + public directory.
  return_path: >-
    Not directly captured in this article — surface via ReFi DAO's own
    channels (blog.refidao.com, refidao.com/local-nodes) if a contribute-back
    hook is needed later.
  currentness: Beta cohort retrospective cited; alpha/beta cohort era, exact date not given in article.
  update_rhythm: Ongoing program; directory presumably updates as new nodes are incubated.
  extraction_status: partial — only the maturity model and cohort statistics were extracted from this article; the incubator curriculum itself was not.
  toolkit_route: layer-3-resource-graph
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/onboarding-members.md
    transformation: summarized
    authorship: ai-assisted
